# Packages installed WITH recommends (--addition-presents ubuntu_desktop).
#
# Standard desktop metapackages carry most of the desktop via Recommends,
# so unlike the base packages.list these are installed without
# --no-install-recommends. Kernel/firmware masking is handled by
# apt-preferences/no-kernel (a "pkg-" trailing-dash entry here would work
# too, but the preferences mask also catches HWE/flavor variants).
ubuntu-desktop
